BlockBeats News, November 20th, top trader Eugene posted on social media that "GOAT breaking through the $1 support/resistance level may rise to $2.

· The meta-trend of AI agents has fully erupted, giving rise to dozens of brand new AI-related tokens;
· The $1 whole number level has switched from a resistance level to a support level, with clear and definite support below;
· DOGE is brewing the next wave of upward momentum, providing more fuel to the ongoing Memecoin frenzy."
